<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -Delta and Pine upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -Delta and Pine upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities analysts Mark Wiltamuth and David Nelson said in a research note they raised their recommendation on Delta and Pine Land Co to buy from accumulate on improved cotton acreage outlook.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3-1/4 to 38-3/8 in late Friday afternoon NYSE trade.</p>
</text>
